  "solution": {
    "text": "Using location of roots :<br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/IkKJ5KArOmUTtZfkibzvK4GT9ki9hZMHpshthFWfftA.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>(i) $\\mathrm{D} \\geq 0$<br/>(ii) $\\frac{-\\mathrm{b}}{2 \\mathrm{a}} \\lt 0$<br/>(iii) a. $\\mathrm{f}(0) \\gt 0$<br/>$\\begin{aligned}<br/>& (p+2)^2-4(2 p+9) \\geq 0 \\\\\n& (p+4)(p-8) \\geq 0 \\quad p+2 \\lt 0 \\quad 2 p+9 \\gt 0<br/>\\end{aligned}$<br/>Intersection $p \\in\\left(-\\frac{9}{2},-4\\right]$<br/>$\\therefore \\beta-2 \\alpha=-4+9=5$",
    "image": null
